From 4812b42ab8e6bc9777f59b6a30d7429751c0fd59 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kirb <kirb@localhost>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 23:27:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] trusted-server: skip unverified JAR warning, self-update from
 our fork

Private server running our own self-compiled mods.
- Never show the 'MODPACK UPDATE / unverified JARs' DangerScreen or abort
  preload updates for JARs without a Modrinth/CurseForge match.
- On clients, the self-updater ignores Modrinth and only installs the
  patched build listed in trusted-manifest.json on the Kiirb/AutoModpack
  GitHub releases.
---
